aç&#305;lmad&#305;&#287;&#305;na ili&#351;kin sorusu ve Cumhurba&#351;kan&#305;
Yard&#305;mc&#305;s&#305; Fuat Oktay’&#305;n cevab&#305; (7/31007)<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:3.0pt;margin-bottom:0cm;
